    "doctor.agent.unknown": {
      "comment": "Detail line of a check in the setup window's Details list; it follows the check's title (the agent's name), so it is a fragment with no final period. %@ is the command that starts an AI agent, for example claude, in backticks: keep the backticks and the %@. The row appears when the person's login shell was started the way a new terminal window starts it and did not get to the end of its answer (a startup file that exits or waits, for example one that starts tmux), so nobody knows whether the command is installed.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "‏`%@`: لم يُبيّن مكوّن Shell الخاص بالدخول لديك ما إذا كان مُثبّتًا"
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: এটি ইনস্টল করা আছে কি না, আপনার লগইন শেল তা জানায়নি"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: deine Login-Shell hat nicht mitgeteilt, ob der Befehl installiert ist"
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: το κέλυφος εισόδου σας δεν είπε αν είναι εγκατεστημένο"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@`: your login shell did not say whether it is installed"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: tu shell de inicio de sesión no indicó si está instalado"
          }
        },
        "fa": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "‏`%@`: پوستهٔ ورود شما نگفت که آیا نصب شده است یا نه"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@` : votre shell de connexion n’a pas indiqué si la commande est installée"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "‏`%@`: מעטפת ההתחברות לא ציינה אם הפקודה מותקנת"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: आपके लॉगइन शेल ने नहीं बताया कि यह इंस्टॉल है या नहीं"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: shell masuk Anda tidak menyebutkan apakah perintah itu diinstal"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: la tua shell di login non ha detto se è installato"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`：ログインシェルは、見つかったかどうか答えませんでした"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: 로그인 셸이 설치 여부를 알려 주지 않음"
          }
        },
        "mr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: तुमच्या लॉगिन शेलने ते सापडले आहे की नाही हे सांगितले नाही"
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: cangkerang log masuk anda tidak memberitahu sama ada ia dipasang"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: je inlogshell heeft niet laten weten of het geïnstalleerd is"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: powłoka logowania nie podała, czy to polecenie jest zainstalowane"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: seu shell de login não informou se está instalado"
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: shellul de login nu a spus dacă este instalat"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: оболочка входа не сообщила, установлен ли он"
          }
        },
        "ta": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: இது நிறுவப்பட்டுள்ளதா என்று உங்கள் login shell கூறவில்லை"
          }
        },
        "te": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: అది ఇన్‌స్టాల్ అయిందో లేదో మీ login shell చెప్పలేదు"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: เชลล์เข้าสู่ระบบของคุณไม่ได้บอกว่าติดตั้งไว้หรือไม่"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: oturum açma kabuğunuz bunun yüklü olup olmadığını söylemedi"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: ваша оболонка входу не повідомила, чи інстальовано цю команду"
          }
        },
        "ur": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "‏`%@`: آپ کی لاگ ان شیل نے نہیں بتایا کہ وہ انسٹال ہے یا نہیں"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`: shell đăng nhập của bạn không cho biết đã được cài đặt hay chưa"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`：你的登录 shell 没有说明它是否已安装"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "`%@`：你的登入 shell 沒有說明它是否已安裝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
