    "doctor.extension.multiple": {
      "comment": "Detail line of a check in the setup window's Details list; it follows the check's title, so it is a fragment with no final period. %1$@ is a number (2 or more) of places the Finder extension is registered from; %2$@ is the list of their paths.",
