    "doctor.services.none": {
      "comment": "Detail line of a check in the setup window's Details list; it follows the check's title, so it is a fragment with no final period. No Finder Services are installed. Quick Actions is the macOS name of the right-click menu entries that Services provide: use the macOS wording of your language.",
